Selected intern's day-to-day responsibilities include:<br>
<br>
1. Reaching out to individuals and communities and encouraging them to contribute to the foundation's cause.<br>
2. Sharing the foundation's fundraising campaigns across WhatsApp and social media platforms.<br>
3. Liaising with the foundation team to receive campaign material and share updates with donors.<br>
